--- OUTCOME ---
PARTIAL. Real concrete progress delivered: all 4 HLS IPs exported to IP-XACT
packages (the hard prerequisite for the official IP-Integrator flow), and all
5 components synthesized by Vivado to checkpoints. BUT a clean single
integrated co-synth with MEASURED timing was not achieved this session — the
bottom-up DCP-link path hit a Vivado read_checkpoint -cell failure, and the
raw-RTL DCPs carry behavioral divider stubs that distort timing. acceptance
criteria are reported honestly: resources are solid, integrated timing is not.

=== STEP 1: export_design — SUCCESS ===
